<p> Trinkaus				   3.5-6.5 pct	2 yrs</p>
<p>Michael Schubert</p>
<p>    Commerzbank			   3-6 pct	    1 yr</p>
<p> Hypo Research			    3-6 pct	    2 yrs</p>
<p>Stefan Bergheim</p>
<p>    Kleinwort Benson		    4-6 pct	    1 yr</p>
<p>Nick Stamenkovic</p>
<p>    DKB International		   4-6 pct	    1 yr</p>
<p> IBJ					  4-6 pct	    2 yrs</p>
<p>Howard Archer</p>
<p>    Nat West Bank			 4.5-6.5 pct	1 yr</p>
